# Pilot artifacts are byte-exact evidence: the SHA256 baselines in
# results/*/baseline_hashes.csv were computed on the files as they were run
# (CRLF). The repository default (* text=auto eol=lf) would rewrite them on
# checkout and silently invalidate every recorded hash, so line-ending
# conversion is disabled for the cases and the stored results.
#
# The nuXmv logs under results/ are UTF-16LE and must never be touched either.
cases/**        -text
results/**      -text

# Documentation and the re-run script are ordinary text, normalized as usual.
*.md            text eol=lf
scripts/*.py    text eol=lf
